# Required for the results map: the Mappls Web SDK access token.
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored). Anyone loading the page can read this value, so use a
# browser key restricted to your domain in the Mappls console (https://apps.mappls.com/console/).
# Without it the map section reports that the token is missing; there is no in-app entry.
VITE_MAPPLS_TOKEN=
